      "side": 1,
      "message": "The question with the baseboard (or supplying FP_SENSOR to make) is whether we want to call the baseboard \"bloonchipper\". I think the answer is no. Bloonchipper means F412 + FPC1025. It\u0027s confusing to mention \"bloonchipper with ELANxyz sensor\".\n\nUsing the nucleo-f412 baseboard is also confusing because there are settings specific to the nucleo boards (but not the FPMCU) and we would have to override that in pineapple.\n\nSo I think I\u0027ll do the symlinks. Since we want a different board name + avoid code duplication, the symlinks seem reasonable to me even in the long run.",
